saan akka marga bantii manaa irraa","poem":1},{"text":"kan utuu hin guddatin goguu haa taʼan;","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"namichi haamu qabaa isaa guuttachuu,","poem":1},{"text":"yookaan namichi walitti qabu bissii isaa guuttachuu hin dandaʼu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Warri achiin darban, “Eebbi Waaqayyoo isiniif haa taʼu;","poem":1},{"text":"maqaa Waaqayyootiin isin eebbifna” isaaniin hin jedhin.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_bib/PSA/129.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_bib/PSA/130.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_bib/PSA/128.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}